<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 30.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   116/118   123/125     UNQ     240/241</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  123/124   129/131   231/245   255/262</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker prices ended barely changed amid thin talk and scarce enquiries, traders said. Traders said most 380-cst volumes were transacted at $124 per tonne. They said there appeared to be some tightness in the prompt market but enquiries were not strong to push levels higher.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-0870-3082)</p>
</text>
